VALUES (9718, 'tt0415306', NULL, 'Talladega Nights: The Ballad of Ricky Bobby', 'Talladega Nights: The Ballad of Ricky Bobby', 'movie', 2006, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iCiTqsmJz1mO85AHzTiHNkRmb6.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qTVgXx0pgBmsGqc8wJsfbd71ppa.jpg', 'The fastest man on four wheels, Ricky Bobby, is one of the greatest drivers in NASCAR history. A big, hairy American winning machine, Ricky has everything a dimwitted daredevil could want, a luxurious mansion, a smokin'' hot wife, and all the fast food he can eat. But Ricky''s turbo-charged lifestyle hits an unexpected speed bump when he''s bested by flamboyant Euro-idiot Jean Girard and reduced to a fear-ridden wreck.', NULL, NULL, 7.2139, 6.384, 0, 8.76499999999999879e+00, '2026-07-21 03:32:24', '2026-10-13 23:54:24')
