VALUES (11891, 'tt0240468', NULL, 'Kung Pow: Enter the Fist', 'Kung Pow: Enter the Fist', 'movie', 2002, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVsZ1hsJ9g11oCCav4N8ccp9bRw.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zvIhFx35lXEIO2OsVnrpReEH747.jpg', 'A movie within a movie, created to spoof the martial arts genre. Writer/director Steve Oedekerk uses contemporary characters and splices them into a 1970s kung-fu film, weaving the new and old together.  As the main character, The Chosen One, Oedekerk sets off to avenge the deaths of his parents at the hands of kung-fu legend Master Pain. Along the way he encounters some strange characters.', NULL, NULL, 6.3023, 6.509, 0, 1.54536363636363631e+01, '2026-07-21 03:32:24', '2026-10-13 23:54:24')
